# Fractal Architecture Rules (分形架构法则)

## File Header Rule (文件头法则)
All `.ts` files MUST include a JSDoc-style comment block at the top with the following tags:
- `@file`: File name
- `@description`: What the file does
- `@input`: Dependencies/inputs (what this file depends on)
- `@output`: Outputs/exports (what this file exports/provides)
- `@pos`: System positioning/role (where this file fits in the system)

Example:
```typescript
/**
 * @file app.module.ts
 * @description Root application module that orchestrates all feature modules
 * @input AppController, AppService, WatermarkModule
 * @output AppModule (exported class)
 * @pos Root module - entry point for dependency injection
 */
```

## Folder Rule (文件夹法则)
Each directory (src, src/xxx, etc.) MUST contain a `_README.md` file that describes:
- Module positioning (模块定位): What this module/directory does in the system
- Mechanisms (机制): How it works, key patterns used
- File inventory (文件清单): List of files and their purposes

## Update Rule (更新法则)
When modifying code, you MUST synchronously update:
- The file header comments if the file's purpose changes
- The `_README.md` in the directory if files are added/removed or functionality changes
